@base = http://localhost:8080
# Conta de massa local (db/init/002_seed_local.sql), ativa, em BRL.
@account = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Verificacao de vida. Nao depende de nenhuma dependencia externa (RNF-013).
GET {{base}}/health/live

### Verificacao de prontidao. Reflete o armazenamento primario: 503 sem o PostgreSQL.
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Credito (RF-001). Reenviar com a mesma chave devolve 200 e Idempotency-Replayed: true.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/credits
Idempotency-Key: credito-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": "150.00",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-02T10:00:00Z"
}

### Debito (RF-002). Acima do saldo: 422 INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS, sem gravacao.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/debits
Idempotency-Key: debito-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": "40.00",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-02T11:00:00Z"
}

### Posicao corrente (RF-003).
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/balance

### Posicao em instante passado, pela data do fato (RF-004). Instante futuro: 400.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/balance?asOf=2026-10-02T10:30:00Z

### Extrato paginado (RF-005). Use o nextCursor da resposta em ?cursor= para a proxima pagina.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/entries?limit=50

### Estorno (RF-007). Substitua o entryId por um lancamento desta conta.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account}}/entries/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/reversals
Idempotency-Key: estorno-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-02T12:00:00Z"
}

### Transferencia (RF-012): debito na origem e credito no destino, numa unica transacao.
### Origem igual ao destino: 400 SAME_ACCOUNT_TRANSFER. Reenvio com a mesma chave: 200.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/transfers
Idempotency-Key: transferencia-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{account}}",
  "destinationAccountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amount": "10.00",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-05T12:00:00Z"
}
